ecution_backend: any\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/authoring-workflow.md:54:│  Phase 8: DISPATCH      hand off to executor per execution_backend│\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/authoring-workflow.md:209:The spec's frontmatter carries an `execution_backend:` field that names the canonical\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/authoring-workflow.md:216:| `execution_backend` value | Where to find the dispatch command |\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/authoring-workflow.md:226:- Recommended dispatch command per `execution_backend`\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/schemas/task-plan.schema.json:53:      \"required\": [\"id\", \"title\", \"effort\", \"profile\", \"agent\", \"execution_backend\", \"depends_on\", \"touches_paths\", \"creates_paths\", \"source_note\", \"why\", \"goal\", \"evals\"],\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/schemas/task-plan.schema.json:60:        \"execution_backend\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/schemas/task-spec-frontmatter.schema.json:24:    \"execution_backend\",\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/schemas/task-spec-frontmatter.schema.json:154:    \"execution_backend\": {\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/concepts/effort-gate.md:21:`execution_backend` remains an open string. The default L-eligible set is:\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/quick-reference.md:13:taskspec handoff tasks/T-…-leaf.md --backend codex --out .taskspec/handoffs/attempt.json\n.agents/skills/task-spec/references/quick-reference.md:41:execution_backend: any","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
